      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the progressive one definitely feels a bit more frantic/agitated than i expected though. can u rewrite the progressive monologue so they sound more like they're making a logical, intellectual case for change instead of just being angry? i want them to sound like someone who is actually a smart strategist, not just someone shouting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
