      "content": "that's much better. the progressive feels much more substantial now. \n\nnow, looking at the traditionalist again... the first version was a little weird/clunky with the 'rednecks' line and 'dog on the china'. it didn't really sound like a 'wise' leader. can you rewrite the traditionalist monologue to be more intellectual as well? i want both characters to be equally smart and composed, so it's a real battle of wits between two legitimate viewpoints rather than one person being calm and the other being emotional.",
